    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "4.3",
      "title": "Eye slots",
      "body": "Eye slots should resemble sources for the visor.\nEye slots should not exceed 25mm tall to prevent any injury.\n\nIt is allowed to add up to two (2) safety Eye bars per Eye slot. Externally riveted Eye bars and integrated Eye bars are not allowed.\n\nEye bars must conform to the “Eye bars” rules document.",
