    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "4.4",
      "title": "Aventail",
      "body": "Nasal and Breteche helmets must be worn with chainmail Aventails. Fabric or scales Aventails are not allowed.\n\nAventails must conform to the “Aventails” document.\n\nAventails must be attached to the bascinet by a suspension system made of vervelles and leather.\nThe Aventail must be fastened down to the edge of a padded pelerine attached to the helmet liner.\nAny additional protective plates covering the cervical spine must be hidden under the Aventail.",
