    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "4.5",
      "title": "Others",
      "body": "Nasal and Breteche helmets may be decorated in the spirit of medieval styles, such as orle, torse, decorated Aventails (with copper/brass chainmail rings), vervelle covers and coat of arms badges, etc. Such decoration must be made in coherence with historical sources.\n\nUsing modern and/or offensive imagery and slogans is prohibited.",
